# copyrighted game files -- never commit these, no matter where they land.
# This repo ships translation text and tools only; every build/test step reads
# game files from outside the repo tree (an install dir, a DLC dir passed on
# the command line) -- if one of these patterns matches something tracked,
# that's a mistake, not a deliberate asset.
/eboot.bin
/eboot.elf
/Script.cpk
/Table.cpk
/UI.cpk
/DLC/
